comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T08:15:12.708Z",codex,"Duplicate check: canonical orient, all seven open items and four in-progress items inspected; all-status release tag membership branch timestamp search plus specific unmerged and membership searches found no existing owner. Historical full-tag foundation pmc-qm7s is closed and is retained as parent. Consumer reproduction is pm-cli PR 1228 at 9775c9480 versus tag v2026.9.10."
  "2026-09-10T08:21:47.665Z",codex,"new real Git fixture failed before implementation (missing resolver), then reproduced closure predating unrelated release and passed after tag membership verification. The fixture includes subsequent first-containing and later tags. Shared API keeps tracker documents untouched, resolves timestamp-placement corrections by SDK-parsed tagged item state, and reports membership provenance. Read-only consumer probe completed successfully against pm-cli; comparing extension-native item population before final attribution proof."
  "2026-09-10T08:32:39.332Z",codex,"Verification: 472 tests pass with exact 100 percent line/branch/function coverage across all 12 measured source files; all 156 declarations across 15 files have docstrings. Type checks, npm production audit (zero vulnerabilities), package dry-run, release-date and provenance-publish guards pass. Tracker validation has zero history drift; existing historical resolution and provenance advisories retain their baseline. Native pm-cli SDK consumer keeps 2351 entries and moves the four PR 1228 items to Unreleased. Five previous timestamp-only attributions also move to their first containing tags; tagged tsx, jscpd, Sentry and typescript-eslint manifests corroborate the corrected release boundaries. Real Git fixtures verify later regenerations, explicit release pins, Markdown/TOON parsing, pending omission, and fail-closed corrupt evidence."
